<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Mulae.Production — Video & Foto Dokumentasi Event</title>
<meta name="description" content="Mulae.Production menangani videografi, fotografi, dan dokumentasi event korporat dari perencanaan hingga hasil akhir yang siap tayang.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Big+Shoulders:wght@500;700;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#0B0F1A;
    --ink-2:#131B2E;
    --ink-3:#1B2540;
    --ivory:#F6F3EC;
    --ivory-2:#EDE8DC;
    --brass:#C9A15A;
    --brass-soft:#D9BC85;
    --steel:#8892A6;
    --rec:#E2483B;
    --line-on-dark: rgba(246,243,236,0.14);
    --line-on-light: rgba(11,15,26,0.14);
    --display: 'Big Shoulders', sans-serif;
    --body: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--ivory);
    font-family:var(--body);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;}
  section{position:relative;}
  .wrap{
    max-width:1180px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 32px;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brass);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:7px;height:7px;
    background:var(--brass);
    border-radius:1px;
    flex:none;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-weight:900;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    line-height:.92;
    margin:0;
    letter-spacing:.01em;
  }
  h2{ font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,58px); }
  h3{ font-size:clamp(20px,2.4vw,26px); letter-spacing:.02em;}
  p{ line-height:1.65; color:var(--steel); margin:0; }
  .on-light p{ color:#4B4433; }
  .on-light{ color:var(--ink); }

  /* ---------- viewfinder signature corners ---------- */
  .viewfinder{ position:relative; }
  .viewfinder::before,
  .viewfinder::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    width:18px;height:18px;
    border-color:var(--brass);
    border-style:solid;
    border-width:0;
    opacity:.85;
    transition:width .35s ease, height .35s ease, opacity .35s ease;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .viewfinder::before{
    top:-1px; left:-1px;
    border-top-width:2px; border-left-width:2px;
  }
  .viewfinder::after{
    bottom:-1px; right:-1px;
    border-bottom-width:2px; border-right-width:2px;
  }
  .viewfinder:hover::before,
  .viewfinder:hover::after{
    width:26px;height:26px;
    opacity:1;
  }

  /* ---------- buttons ---------- */
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    padding:14px 26px;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:.06em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    border:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
    transition:border-color .25s ease, background .25s ease, color .25s ease, transform .2s ease;
  }
  .btn-solid{
    background:var(--brass);
    color:var(--ink);
    border-color:var(--brass);
  }
  .btn-solid:hover{ background:var(--brass-soft); transform:translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ border-color:var(--brass); color:var(--brass); transform:translateY(-2px); }
  .on-light .btn-ghost{ border-color:var(--line-on-light); }

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
  header{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
    background:rgba(11,15,26,.82);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
  }
  .nav{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding:18px 32px;
    max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto;
  }
  .logo{
    font-family:var(--display);
    font-weight:900;
    font-size:20px;
    letter-spacing:.03em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  }
  .rec-dot{
    width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--rec);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(226,72,59,.6);
    animation:pulse 1.6s infinite;
    flex:none;
  }
  @keyframes pulse{
    0%{ box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(226,72,59,.55); }
    70%{ box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(226,72,59,0); }
    100%{ box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(226,72,59,0); }
  }
  .nav-links{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:34px;
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .nav-links a{ color:var(--ivory); opacity:.75; transition:opacity .2s; }
  .nav-links a:hover{ opacity:1; color:var(--brass); }
  .nav-cta{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:22px; }
  .burger{ display:none; background:none; border:0; cursor:pointer; color:var(--ivory); }

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .nav-links{
      position:fixed; inset:64px 0 0 0; background:var(--ink);
      flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap:30px;
      font-size:16px;
      transform:translateY(-110%); transition:transform .35s ease;
    }
    .nav-links.open{ transform:translateY(0); }
    .burger{ display:block; }
    .nav-cta .btn-solid{ display:none; }
  }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:168px 0 90px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 0%, rgba(201,161,90,.14), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 20%, rgba(27,37,64,.9), transparent 60%),
      var(--ink);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;
    gap:60px;
    align-items:end;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(46px,7.4vw,96px);
    margin:20px 0 26px;
  }
  .hero h1 span{ color:var(--brass); }
  .hero-sub{
    max-width:460px;
    margin-bottom:34px;
  }
  .hero-actions{ display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .hero-panel{
    border:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
    padding:26px;
    background:rgba(19,27,46,.5);
  }
  .timecode{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);
    letter-spacing:.06em;
    color:var(--ivory);
  }
  .timecode-label{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--steel);
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-top:8px;
  }
  .hero-panel-row{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
    margin-top:22px; padding-top:18px;
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){
    .hero-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .hero{ padding-top:130px; }
  }

  /* ---------- stats strip ---------- */
  .stats{
    background:var(--ink-2);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
    padding:34px 0;
  }
  .stats-row{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:20px;
  }
  .stat b{
    display:block;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px);
    color:var(--brass-soft);
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .stat span{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--steel);
  }
  @media (max-width:700px){
    .stats-row{ grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); row-gap:26px; }
  }

  /* ---------- section heads ---------- */
  .section{ padding:110px 0; }
  .section-head{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end;
    gap:30px; margin-bottom:56px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .section-head p{ max-width:380px; }
  .on-light .eyebrow{ color:#8A5E1F; }

  /* ---------- services ---------- */
  .services{ background:var(--ivory); }
  .service-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--line-on-light);
    border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);
  }
  .service-card{
    background:var(--ivory);
    padding:34px 30px 30px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .service-num{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    color:#B08D57;
    font-size:12.5px;
    margin-bottom:22px;
    display:block;
  }
  .service-card h3{ margin-bottom:14px; }
  .service-card p{ font-size:14.5px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .service-tags{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
  .service-tags span{
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:.04em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:5px 9px;
    border:1px solid var(--line-on-light);
    color:#6B6250;
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){ .service-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  /* ---------- showreel ---------- */
  .showreel-wrap{ padding:0 0 110px; background:var(--ivory); }
  .showreel{
    position:relative;
    aspect-ratio:16/9;
    background:
      linear-gradient(120deg, #17203A, #0B0F1A 60%);
    overflow:hidden;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .showreel::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(246,243,236,.035) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px);
  }
  .showreel-poster{
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    gap:18px;
    color:var(--ivory);
  }
  .play-ring{
    width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:50%;
    border:1.5px solid var(--brass);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    transition:transform .3s ease, background .3s ease;
  }
  .showreel:hover .play-ring{ transform:scale(1.08); background:rgba(201,161,90,.12); }
  .play-ring svg{ margin-left:4px; }
  .showreel-cap{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--brass-soft);
  }
  .showreel iframe{ width:100%; height:100%; border:0; position:absolute; inset:0; }

  /* ---------- portfolio ---------- */
  .portfolio{ background:var(--ink); }
  .folio-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:22px;
  }
  .folio-card{
    aspect-ratio:3/4;
    position:relative;
    padding:18px;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end;
    border:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .folio-card .bg{
    position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:0;
  }
  .folio-card .content{ position:relative; z-index:2; }
  .folio-card .cat{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:10.5px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brass-soft); margin-bottom:8px; display:block;
  }
  .folio-card h3{ font-size:19px; }
  .folio-card::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1;
    background:linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(11,15,26,.92) 10%, rgba(11,15,26,.25) 60%, rgba(11,15,26,.05));
  }
  .f1 .bg{ background:linear-gradient(155deg,#2A3A63,#0B0F1A 70%); }
  .f2 .bg{ background:linear-gradient(155deg,#3B2A1E,#0B0F1A 70%); }
  .f3 .bg{ background:linear-gradient(155deg,#1E3B33,#0B0F1A 70%); }
  .f4 .bg{ background:linear-gradient(155deg,#3B1E2C,#0B0F1A 70%); }
  .folio-play{
    position:absolute; top:16px; right:16px; z-index:2;
    width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;
    border:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    opacity:0; transform:translateY(-6px);
    transition:opacity .3s ease, transform .3s ease, border-color .3s ease;
  }
  .folio-card:hover .folio-play{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); border-color:var(--brass); }
  @media (max-width:960px){ .folio-grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); } }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .folio-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  /* ---------- process ---------- */
  .process{ background:var(--ivory); }
  .filmstrip{
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-light);
  }
  .frame-row{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 2fr;
    align-items:center;
    gap:24px;
    padding:26px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-on-light);
  }
  .frame-row .sprocket{
    display:flex; gap:6px;
    font-family:var(--mono); color:#B08D57; font-size:13px;
  }
  .frame-row .sprocket i{
    width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;
    background:#D8CDB0; display:inline-block;
  }
  .frame-tc{ font-family:var(--mono); font-size:13.5px; color:#8A5E1F; }
  .frame-row h3{ margin-bottom:6px; font-size:19px; }
  .frame-row p{ font-size:14px; max-width:520px; }
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .frame-row{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:8px; }
  }

  /* ---------- testimonials ---------- */
  .testimonials{ background:var(--ink-2); border-top:1px solid var(--line-on-dark); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);}
  .quote-grid{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:1px;
    background:var(--line-on-dark); border:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
  }
  .quote-card{ background:var(--ink-2); padding:36px 34px; }
  .quote-mark{ font-family:var(--display); font-size:44px; color:var(--brass); line-height:1; }
  .quote-card p.quote{ color:var(--ivory); font-size:16.5px; margin:16px 0 22px; line-height:1.6; }
  .quote-name{ font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.05em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--steel); }
  .quote-name b{ color:var(--ivory); display:block; font-family:var(--body); font-weight:600; font-size:14.5px; text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0; margin-bottom:2px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .quote-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  /* ---------- CTA ---------- */
  .cta{
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#C9A15A,#A9803F);
    color:var(--ink);
    padding:90px 0;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .cta h2{ color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:18px; }
  .cta p{ color:#3A2E17; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto 32px; }
  .cta .btn-solid{ background:var(--ink); color:var(--ivory); border-color:var(--ink); }
  .cta .btn-solid:hover{ background:#000; }
  .cta .btn-ghost{ border-color:rgba(11,15,26,.35); }
  .cta .btn-ghost:hover{ color:var(--ink); border-color:var(--ink); }
  .cta-actions{ display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{ background:var(--ink); padding:64px 0 30px; }
  .footer-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap:40px;
    padding-bottom:50px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-on-dark);
  }
  .footer-grid h4{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--steel); margin:0 0 16px;
  }
  .footer-grid li{ margin-bottom:10px; font-size:14.5px; }
  .footer-grid a:hover{ color:var(--brass); }
  .footer-bottom{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    padding-top:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:14px;
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:11.5px; color:var(--steel);
    letter-spacing:.04em;
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .footer-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }

  /* ---------- reveal ---------- */
  .reveal{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(22px); transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease; }
  .reveal.in{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .reveal{ opacity:1; transform:none; transition:none; }
    .rec-dot{ animation:none; }
    html{ scroll-behavior:auto; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav class="nav">
    <a href="#top" class="logo"><span class="rec-dot"></span>Mulae<span style="color:var(--brass)">.</span>Production</a>
    <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <li><a href="#layanan">Layanan</a></li>
      <li><a href="#portofolio">Portofolio</a></li>
      <li><a href="#proses">Proses</a></li>
      <li><a href="#testimoni">Testimoni</a></li>
      <li><a href="#kontak">Kontak</a></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <a href="#kontak" class="btn btn-solid">Konsultasi Gratis</a>
      <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Buka menu">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<main id="top">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Videografi &amp; Fotografi Dokumentasi Event</div>
        <h1>Setiap Event<br>Berjalan <span>Sekali.</span><br>Kami Merekamnya<br>Selamanya.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Mulae.Production menangani dokumentasi konferensi, product launch, hingga acara korporat perusahaan Anda — dari perencanaan shot list sampai file akhir siap tayang.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#portofolio" class="btn btn-ghost">Lihat Portofolio</a>
          <a href="#kontak" class="btn btn-solid">Diskusikan Event Anda</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-panel viewfinder">
        <div class="timecode" id="timecode">00:00:00:00</div>
        <div class="timecode-label">Durasi rata-rata produksi hingga delivery</div>
        <div class="hero-panel-row">
          <div>
            <div class="timecode" style="font-size:20px;">48<span style="color:var(--steel);font-size:14px;"> jam</span></div>
            <div class="timecode-label">Same-day highlight</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="timecode" style="font-size:20px;">4K</div>
            <div class="timecode-label">Resolusi standar</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS -->
  <section class="stats">
    <div class="wrap stats-row">
      <div class="stat"><b>250+</b><span>Event ditangani</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>8 Thn</b><span>Pengalaman produksi</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>40+</b><span>Klien korporat</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>98%</b><span>Klien booking ulang</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LAYANAN -->
  <section class="section services" id="layanan">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">00 — Layanan</div>
          <h2>Yang Kami Kerjakan</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="on-light">Tim kamera, editor, dan produser bekerja sebagai satu unit di setiap event — bukan vendor lepas yang digabung mendadak.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-grid reveal">
        <div class="service-card viewfinder">
          <span class="service-num">00:01</span>
          <h3>Videografi Event</h3>
          <p>Liputan multi-kamera untuk seminar, konferensi, dan seremoni korporat, lengkap dengan audio line-in dari panggung.</p>
          <div class="service-tags"><span>Multi-kamera</span><span>Audio Line-in</span><span>Highlight Video</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card viewfinder">
          <span class="service-num">00:02</span>
          <h3>Fotografi Dokumentasi</h3>
          <p>Foto candid dan formal — sesi networking, sambutan direksi, hingga detail venue — diserahkan dalam hitungan hari.</p>
          <div class="service-tags"><span>Candid</span><span>Formal Portrait</span><span>Same-day Preview</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card viewfinder">
          <span class="service-num">00:03</span>
          <h3>Same-Day Edit</h3>
          <p>Video ringkasan 2–3 menit yang tayang di penutupan acara — untuk momen yang butuh dampak instan di hari yang sama.</p>
          <div class="service-tags"><span>Edit Kilat</span><span>Tayang di Venue</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card viewfinder">
          <span class="service-num">00:04</span>
          <h3>Live Streaming</h3>
          <p>Siaran langsung ke YouTube, Zoom, atau platform internal perusahaan, dengan switching multi-kamera dan grafis on-screen.</p>
          <div class="service-tags"><span>Multi-platform</span><span>Grafis On-screen</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card viewfinder">
